# Deviation (DEVIATIONS "Regex dialect"): joni has no \N, \O or \o{...}: it reads the escape as the letter
case regex/char-octal-codepoint
deviation regex-escape-as-letter
arg -c
filter .re as $re | .f as $f | .s | try [match($re; $f)] catch .
stdin {"s": "xAx", "re": "\\\\o{101}", "f": "g"}\n
engine-stdout []\n
end

